  "description": "<p>Hi there,</p>\r\n<p>Are you looking for innovative automotive accessories to feature on your platform? Look no further than TYPE S! We are excited to invite you to join our affiliate program and become a part of our journey to enhance driving experiences with top-notch automotive products.</p>\r\n<p>For over 20 years, TYPE S has been a leader in automotive innovation, offering a range of products from advanced dashcams to portable jump starters and high-quality LED lighting. Our products are trusted by millions, with over 1 million units of our <a rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_new\" href=\"https://typesauto.com/collections/portable-jump-starters\">jump starters</a> sold at Costco, making us the top manufacturer of <a rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_new\" href=\"https://typesauto.com/collections/dash-cams\">dashcams</a> in the U.S., and the official partners of Formula Drift for <a rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_new\" href=\"https://typesauto.com/collections/formula-drift-led-kits\">Car LED Lighting</a>.</p>\r\n<p>As a TYPE S affiliate, you'll earn a competitive 10% commission on all sales referred through your unique affiliate link. We also offer a 30-day cookie window and are happy to provide additional imagery upon request to support your promotional efforts.</p>\r\n<p>Joining our program is easy! Simply sign up through Rakuten and start promoting TYPE S to your audience. Whether you're an automotive blogger, a tech reviewer, or a lifestyle influencer, TYPE S is the perfect addition to your content.</p>\r\n<p>Ready to get started? Click the link below to join our affiliate program today!</p>\r\n<p>Thank you for considering TYPE S. We look forward to partnering with you!</p>\r\n<p>Best regards,&nbsp;<br>Winnie IP<br>Senior eCommerce Manager<br>TYPE S TOURING ITEMS</p>",
